# The widened values: nanoseconds truncate to µs (row 3 stays on Feb 29), the +02:00 timestamps
# are UTC instants, Float32 0.1 widens to 0.10000000149011612, the decimal reads as a real.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../data/types.parquet' | project-away bin
---- expected
id   | ts_ns                       | ts_tz                | date                 | i16    | u32        | f32                      | dict   | dec
long | datetime                    | datetime             | datetime             | long   | long       | real                     | string | real
-----+-----------------------------+----------------------+----------------------+--------+------------+--------------------------+--------+---------
   1 | 2024-01-15T09:30:00.123456Z | 2024-01-15T09:30:00Z | 2024-01-15T00:00:00Z | -32768 |          0 |    0.10000000149011612   | red    | 12345.67
   2 | 1969-12-31T23:59:59Z        | 2024-06-30T22:30:00Z | 1969-12-31T00:00:00Z |      0 |          1 |   -1.5                   | green  |    -0.01
   3 | 2024-02-29T23:59:59.999999Z | 1970-01-01T00:00:00Z | 2024-02-29T00:00:00Z |  32767 | 4294967295 |    3.4028234663852886e38 | red    |     0.0
   4 | null                        | null                 | null                 |   null |       null | null                     | null   |  null
